# A Cool contest at Normal rank, with a poffin-fed Roselia.
#
# The two halves of Hearthome meet in this recipe. The poffin is cooked the
# way the pot cooks one, one flavour, an amount and a smoothness through
# Poffin_MakePoffin, and then fed through the poffin case's own arithmetic,
# which is what leaves `cool` at 60 and `sheen` at 30 on the entry. The
# contest is judged on those numbers, so a station that set them by hand
# would be asserting on its own input.
#
# The map is Hearthome City rather than the Contest Hall lobby: the lobby's
# map change never finishes headless, and the contest lab does not need it --
# the game's own practice path runs the same application from the lobby floor.

name RIBBON
gender GENDER_MALE
trainer-id 20481
money 3000
var VAR_PLAYER_STARTER SPECIES_TURTWIG
party SPECIES_ROSELIA 30 ITEM_NONE
poffin FLAVOR_SPICY 60 30
feed-poffin 0 0
map MAP_HEADER_HEARTHOME_CITY 0x1D1 0x2BA FACE_DOWN
